{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17357","headline":"奉陪李大夫九日龙沙宴会 · 权德舆","name":"奉陪李大夫九日龙沙宴会","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙沙重九会，千骑驻旌旗。\n水木秋光净，丝桐雅奏迟。\n烟芜敛暝色，霜菊发寒姿。\n今日从公醉，全胜落帽时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}